  → **Partially observed.** The main characters and many pedestrians are wearing light to medium jackets or long-sleeved tops. However, no heavy coats, scarves, or winter hats are visible — suggesting it’s not deep winter.\n\n3. **Visible trees with leaves (green or changing colors)**  \n   → **Observed in Frames 6–7:** Trees in the plaza are full of **green leaves**, indicating **not autumn** (where leaves would be changing color or falling). No yellow, orange, or red foliage is visible.\n\n4. **Visible trees without leaves (bare branches)**  \n   → **Not observed.** All visible trees have full foliage.\n\n5. **People using umbrellas or rain gear**  \n   → **Not observed.** No umbrellas, raincoats, or wet ground visible.\n\n6. **People showing visible breath in cold air**  \n   → **Not observed.** No visible breath, suggesting temperatures are not cold enough for this phenomenon.\n\n---\n\n### Seasonal Inference:\n\n- The presence of **green, leafy trees** rules out autumn (which is characterized by changing or falling leaves).\n- The clothing worn (light jackets, long sleeves) suggests **mild to cool temperatures**, possibly **spring or early fall**, but **not autumn** as defined by visual leaf color change.\n- Since the trees are fully green and no autumnal indicators are present, **autumn is not supported**.\n\n---\n\n### Conclusion:\n\n✅ **Answer ‘0’ (Autumn) is INCORRECT.**\n\nThe visual evidence points more toward **spring or early summer**, given the green foliage and transitional clothing. If forced to choose from the provided options, **‘0’ (Autumn)** does not match the visual data.\n\n**Correct seasonal classification based on evidence: Not Autumn.**'}, {'batch_start': 30, 'batch_end': 60, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0137.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0138.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0139.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/vid