mmer**, not autumn.\n\n4. **Visible trees without leaves (bare branches)**  \n   → No bare trees are visible. All trees are fully leafed.\n\n5. **People using umbrellas or rain gear**  \n   → No umbrellas or rain gear are visible in any frame.\n\n6. **People showing visible breath in cold air**  \n   → No visible breath; weather appears mild and clear.\n\n---\n\n### Conclusion:\n\nThe visual evidence — especially the **green, fully-leafed trees** visible across multiple frames — strongly suggests the season is **not autumn**. Autumn would typically show trees with changing or falling leaves. The clothing is moderate, not cold-weather gear, and there are no other autumn indicators.\n\nThus, the correct answer should **not** be ‘0’ (Autumn). Based on the foliage and attire, **‘1’ (Summer)** or possibly **‘2’ (Spring)** would be more accurate, but **‘0’ is incorrect**.\n\n✅ **Final Verification: Answer ‘0’ (Autumn) is INCORRECT.**'}, {'batch_start': 90, 'batch_end': 120, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0527.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0528.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0529.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0530.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0531.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0532.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0533.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0777.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0778.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0779.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0780.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0781.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0782.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/dat