utumn (fall)**, transitioning into early winter. Here’s the evidence broken down by your requested categories:\n\n---\n\n**1. Clothing Worn by People (including main vloggers):**\n\n- **Main Vloggers**: In Frame 4, one of the main vloggers (likely the one with the black cap/jacket) is visible from behind wearing a **dark, puffy jacket** and a **beanie-style cap**. In Frame 6, the same individual (or the other main vlogger) is wearing a **grey hoodie or light jacket** over a long-sleeve shirt, paired with long pants. This suggests cool, but not freezing, weather.\n  \n- **General Crowd**: Across all frames (especially 2, 3, 4, 5, 6), pedestrians are wearing:\n  - Light to medium jackets (e.g., denim, windbreakers, light puffers)\n  - Long-sleeve shirts and hoodies\n  - Some people wear scarves or beanies (Frame 4, 5, 6)\n  - No heavy winter coats, snow gear, or visible breath (which would suggest deep winter)\n  - No short sleeves, tank tops, or sandals (which would suggest summer)\n\n→ **Conclusion**: Clothing is consistent with **autumn** — cool enough for layers and light outerwear, but not cold enough for heavy winter gear.\n\n---\n\n**2. Tree Conditions:**\n\n- In Frames 2, 3, 4, and 5, tall **palm trees** are visible lining the pedestrian street. Palm trees are evergreen and do not change color or lose leaves seasonally, so they are not useful indicators.\n\n- However, in Frame 6, a **smaller, leafy tree or bush** is visible near the foreground (right side). Its leaves appear **green and full**, with no signs of yellowing, browning, or bare branches.\n\n- In Frame 1 (night scene), trees in the background are not clearly visible, but no bare branches are apparent.\n\n→ **Conclusion**: No evidence of autumn foliage (e.g., red, orange, or yellow leaves) or bare branches. The presence of green, healthy leaves on non-palm trees suggests **late summer or early autumn**, not deep autumn or winter.\n\n---\n\n**3. Weather Indicators:**\n\n- All frames are taken at **nig